// Zed keymap
//
// For information on binding keys, see the Zed
// documentation: https://zed.dev/docs/key-bindings
//
// To see the default key bindings run `zed: open default keymap`
// from the command palette.
//
// Base keymap is "JetBrains" (set in settings.json), so PhpStorm bindings
// apply: ctrl-alt-l formats, ctrl-shift-f finds in files, ctrl-shift-n
// opens files. Only additions on top of that belong here.
[
  {
    "context": "Workspace",
    "bindings": {
      // PhpStorm "Search Everywhere"
      "shift shift": "file_finder::Toggle"
    }
  },
  {
    "context": "Editor",
    "bindings": {
      // "j k": ["workspace::SendKeystrokes", "escape"]
    }
  }
]
